_pdbx_nmr_refine.entry_id           2KDQ 
_pdbx_nmr_refine.method             'simulated annealing' 
_pdbx_nmr_refine.details            
;Structures of the HIV-1 TAR RNA/L-22 complex were calculated with Xplor-NIH. Backbone dihedral angle restraints for the peptide were estimated using chemical shift data and TALOS. Structures were originally calculated without RDCs to test for convergence and adherence to the NOE data. RDC restraints were then applied as susceptibility anisotropy restraints with a harmonic potential well.
;
_pdbx_nmr_refine.software_ordinal   1 
